<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-GOLD COAST CLASSIC RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GOLD COAST CLASSIC RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GOLD COAST, Australia 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the Gold</p>
<p>Coast Classic women's tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>Natalie Dech (France) beat Els Callens (Belgium) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Maria Louisa Serna (Spain) beat 5-Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania)</p>
<p>6-4 7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>Anne-Gaelle Sidot (France) beat 7-Katarina Studenikova</p>
<p>(Slovakia) 6-4 1-1</p>
<p>4-Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) beat Sandrine Testud (France) 6-4</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>6-Ai Sugiyama (Japan) beat Rita Grande (Italy) 6-7 (7-5) 6-2</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Rachel McQuillan (Australia) beat Barbara Rittner (Germany) 7-5</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>3-Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) beat Catalina Cristea (Romania)</p>
<p>6-3 6-4</p>
<p>1-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) beat Miriam Oremans</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 7-6 (7-5) 6-0</p>
</text>
